      <activity id="af4ab891-2f24-592e-9883-2b56fb8878bb" activityNameId="028119ec-d9bb-5d14-9234-ac19616b7a8e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Furnace, wood chips, hardwood, 300kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Furnace, wood chips, hardwood, 300kW
Inventory refers to the production of a wood chips furnace 300kW. Composition of the previous inventory was used and updated with the average weight of current wood chips furnaces available in Switzerland.\nTechnology: average technology\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Holzenergie\nLocal subcategory: Heizungssysteme\nUVEK 2022 source file:EcoSpold_furnace_wood chips_300kW_v0.3_lwa.xml\n\n
UUID: 7ef8a32c-b8de-39f7-8ec4-a4434bd723c4
Includes materials, transports and energy used for the fabrication of the furnace, the chimney, the storage silo, the automatic fuel supply and the automatic control technique.
Location: undefined
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7ef8a32c-b8de-39f7-8ec4-a4434bd723c4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
